 "name_en": "Request for Price (1XF)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Request for Price (1XF)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0799997b2d3f4371a808cb4f83b3ffa6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0799997b2d3f4371a808cb4f83b3ffa6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">With this scope item, you can create requests for quotations in the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> system and send them to a supplier via e-mail or as a printed version by mail. The suppliers provide their quotations via e-mail or by mail as well. You can manually create a quotation in the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> system using the Manage Supplier Quotations app. By default, a new quotation has the status In Preparation. You select a quotation that you want to award and submit it for approval. After awarding the quotation, the follow-on documents are created in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>. The quotations that do not meet your requirements must be manually set to Rejected/Completed.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0799997b2d3f4371a808cb4f83b3ffa6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a request for quotation and automatically submit it to the corresponding suppliers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive the supplier proposals electronically and automatically create supplier quotations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Compare and award the corresponding quotations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create follow-on documents</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0799997b2d3f4371a808cb4f83b3ffa6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Specify individual output channels for suppliers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce the time needed to evaluate proposals from qualified bidders with qualified responses</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>价格请求 (1XF)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio0799997b2d3f4371a808cb4f83b3ffa6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0799997b2d3f4371a808cb4f83b3ffa6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过此范围项目，您可以在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 系统中创建询价，并通过电子邮件或以邮件打印版本的形式将其发送给供应商。供应商还通过电子邮件或邮件提供其报价。您可以使用管理供应商报价应用在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 系统中手动创建报价。缺省情况下，新报价的状态为准备中。选择要授标的报价并提交以供审批。授标报价后，将在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中创建后续凭证。必须将不符合要求的报价手动设置为已拒绝/已完成。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0799997b2d3f4371a808cb4f83b3ffa6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建报价请求，并自动将其提交给相应的供应商</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">以电子方式接收供应商建议，并自动创建供应商报价</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">比较和授标相应的报价</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建后续凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio0799997b2d3f4371a808cb4f83b3ffa6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">指定供应商的单个输出渠道</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过合格的投标商的合格响应，减少评估建议所需的时间</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
